  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2702.11 \"Permittee\" means hospital emergency personnel to whom a hospital emergency permit has been issued by the commissioner.\n\nSource. #4976, eff 11-14-90; ss and moved by #6174, eff 1-26-96 (from Saf-C 2702), EXPIRED: 1-26-04\n\nNew. #8073, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10084, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13214-A, eff 6-16-21",
